@startuml teacher create test
title Teacher Create Test — Sequence Diagram (uses Factory to build test)

actor Teacher <<actor>>
boundary "CreateTestPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control "TestController" as Controller <<control>>
control "TestService" as Service <<control>>
control "TestFactory" as Factory <<control>>
control "TestRepository" as Repository <<control>>
entity "Test" as TestModel <<entity>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<entity>>

Teacher -> UI: Submit new test definition
UI -> Controller: POST /tests (CreateTestRequest)
Controller -> Controller: validate(request)
alt validation fails
	Controller --> UI: 422 ValidationErrors
else
	Controller -> Service: createTest(validRequest)
	Service -> Factory: buildTestAggregate(validRequest)
	Factory --> Service: TestAggregate
	Service -> Repository: persist(TestAggregate)
	Repository -> DB: INSERT test / questions relations
	TestModel --> Repository: test_id
	Repository --> Service: TestEntity
	Service --> Controller: 201 Created {test_id}
	Controller --> UI: show created test
end

note right of Factory
Factory encapsulates complex assembly of Test, Questions and settings
end note

@enduml